# What gets installed by hand before anything is published. The binaries are
# hundreds of megabytes and the release on GitHub is the copy that keeps — but
# the folder itself stays tracked, through its README, so it is visible in a
# file tree. A folder nobody can find is a folder nobody installs from.
Installers/*
!Installers/README.md

# wrangler keeps a local cache of which Cloudflare account is logged in.
.wrangler/
